DS4 modifications: independent native C tokenizer, projection-only PLE,
bidirectional local/full attention using the existing numeric C API, ragged
batch isolation, host mean/L2 pooling and explicit resource ownership.
The pinned checkpoint supplies tokenizer/configuration data. Compilation and
Transformers oracles are development tools; no Python serving dependency.
